---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
const author = "Tu Nombre"; 
---

<footer class="bg-gray-800 border-t border-gray-700/50 py-8 px-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
            &copy; {currentYear} {author}. Desarrollado con ❤️ y <span class="text-white font-bold">Astro</span>.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-600">
            Diseño adaptado a los colores Verde, Dorado y Azul.
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>